questions.q:
What will be printed by the following loop?
```java
String s = "BLUEJ";
for (int i = 1; i <= s.length(); i++) {
    System.out.println(s.substring(0, i));
}
```

questions.answer:
```java
for (int i = s.length(); i >= 1; i--) {
    System.out.println(s.substring(0, i));
}
```

